{"id": "EUVD-2026-98059", "enisaUuid": "9fe52fea-df45-3c30-86a2-ec8ebab02dae", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.110.0 and 16.x before 16.21.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in certain endpoints that handle party records, allowing authenticated users to modify data beyond their permitted role. Attackers with low-privileged accounts can send requests to these endpoints to make unauthorized changes to party records.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:44:32", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-5mcx-cjjh-gc64", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.110.0-missing-authorization-in-party-record-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109668", "GHSA-9m7p-fw22-r42w"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "983bcbde-293a-3747-91d5-ad7061087232", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.21.0"}, {"id": "b8221291-f6e1-3db2-8459-1a3ad30f4491", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.110.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bafd37fc-2472-3d7f-90f5-e2d0275f4d74", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}